1
00:00:00,199 --> 00:00:01,199
(Amy:)Please?

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,530
(Sheldon:)Fine.

3
00:00:05,137 --> 00:00:07,307
"As Cooper prepared to depart,

4
00:00:07,306 --> 00:00:09,876
"tears filled Amelia's eyes.

5
00:00:09,875 --> 00:00:13,445
"He took her hand in his
and said, 'I can't stay,

6
00:00:13,445 --> 00:00:15,545
"but I will never forget you.'

7
00:00:15,547 --> 00:00:18,587
"He brushed his fingers
against her cheek,

8
00:00:18,584 --> 00:00:21,384
"then quickly stepped
into the machine.

9
00:00:21,386 --> 00:00:23,616
"'Please don't go,'
she whispered.

10
00:00:23,622 --> 00:00:25,622
"But it was too late.

11
00:00:25,624 --> 00:00:27,624
"The engine hummed to life.

12
00:00:27,626 --> 00:00:29,626
(Bernadette:)But they didn't even kiss.

13
00:00:29,628 --> 00:00:31,428
AMY:
"She turned away,

14
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:33,060
"wiping her eyes.

15
00:00:33,065 --> 00:00:34,595
"She couldn't bear to watch

16
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:37,900
"her one chance at true love
disappear forever.

17
00:00:37,903 --> 00:00:41,343
"Then... she felt a strong
hand on her shoulder

18
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,440
"spin her around.

19
00:00:42,441 --> 00:00:43,911
"It was Cooper.

20
00:00:43,909 --> 00:00:45,009
(gasps)

21
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:47,510
(whispers):
Yes!

22
00:00:47,513 --> 00:00:49,913
"'What about the future?'
asked Amelia.

23
00:00:49,915 --> 00:00:54,085
"He looked deeply into her eyes
and whispered,

24
00:00:54,086 --> 00:00:56,486
"'There is no future
without you.'

25
00:00:56,488 --> 00:00:58,688
"He pulled her in close.

26
00:00:58,690 --> 00:01:01,660
"She began to
tremble all over.

